    {
      "name": "3. Capacity, Admin Changes and Waitlist",
      "description": "Capacity 1, so Bob fills the slot and Alice is rejected. Alice joins the waitlist. The admin edits Bob's reservation (email to Bob), then deletes it (email to Bob). Alice gets the reservation from the waitlist (email to Alice). Bob joins the waitlist and leaves it.",
